ui.utilitycraft:info.tank_controller=Stores up to 5 liquid or gas types.\n\nUse steel casing, matching cells and ports. Activate with a wrench. No energy needed.\n\nEach cell adds 256,000 mB, shared across the 5 tanks.\n\nPort I/O: choose Tank 1-5, or Default (Any) for all.
